{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Omicrox is Ultimate Tic Tac Toe with abilities and an unlimited strategic potential.<br><br>Ultimate Tic Tac Toe is a twist on the classic game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each space of the big 3x3 board holds a smaller 3\u00d73 board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/47a1961a4ff75879e429cfcdef9b20fb.avif?t=1765915333\" width=680 height=682 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your move in a small board decides which small board your opponent must play in next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/fd24a68f01ac9d92a20a1a4f6646dfe7.avif?t=1765915333\" width=510 height=510 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a small board by getting 3 in a row to claim that board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/563475426e91f53a52988b8059501336.avif?t=1765915333\" width=510 height=510 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the game by claiming 3 boards in a row.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/00145bfa47cfb9cfa0491d9ed280e48b.avif?t=1765915333\" width=514 height=510 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you play you gain abilities in the form of cards. You can only use one card on each turn and you lose the card on use. Some abilities are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset a board</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/acade6440c0b88e15564ab48c3cba083.avif?t=1765915333\" width=96 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap 2 boards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/28c61bf5c32fecbb47e0a2575a0169a5.avif?t=1765915333\" width=96 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap 2 cells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/fd54c6cc1b6d5d686d0bfff954e28108.avif?t=1765915333\" width=94 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block a board for 2 turns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/6d676c4e9fe1b2c86739c5ebad28f6d7.avif?t=1765915333\" width=94 height=130 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your turn but play a second time when you want</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/cb0f65bbc6babb40ef63417fdb83a71c.avif?t=1765915333\" width=96 height=126 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal a card from your opponent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/32b2a740bc0dc204577c502d3f1871c8.avif?t=1765915333\" width=96 height=128 /></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide on what board your opponent will play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954820/extras/15ffc772e9025b89a